namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy.h#DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy
    src   "The object behind the \"Play Animation with Finished event\" node: plays through the widget and\nfires Finished one frame after the instance ends, naturally or by Stop. Mirrors UMG's\nUWidgetAnimationPlayCallbackProxy; the K2 node that spawns it lives in DreamGUIK2Nodes.\n\nTakes any UDreamWidget, not only a user widget. An animation component is an ordinary behaviour\nand sits on plain widgets all the time; requiring a UDreamUserWidget here meant those animations\nhad no async node at all, while a graph holding one had nothing to connect. A user widget still\nplays through its own forwarding layer, which is what routes a handle to the right component."
    text  "“播放动画并触发 Finished 事件”节点背后的对象：在控件上播放动画，并\n在实例结束后（自然结束或通过 Stop 停止）的一帧触发 Finished。对应 UMG 的\nUWidgetAnimationPlayCallbackProxy；生成它的 K2 节点位于 DreamGUIK2Nodes 中。\n\n接受任意 UDreamWidget，而不仅是用户控件。动画组件是一种普通行为，\n经常挂在普通控件上；在此要求 UDreamUserWidget，意味着这些动画\n根本没有异步节点，而持有该控件的图表也没有可连接的对象。用户控件仍\n通过自己的转发层播放，由该层将句柄路由到正确的组件。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy:Finished {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy.h#DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy:Finished
    src   "The instance ended. Fired the frame after, so a graph can safely play the next animation."
    text  "实例已结束。在之后一帧触发，因此图表可以安全地播放下一个动画。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy:NewPlayAnimationProxyObject {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy.h#DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy:NewPlayAnimationProxyObject
    src   "Play an animation on the widget and trigger the Finished event when the instance is done."
    text  "在控件上播放动画，并在实例完成时触发“完成”事件。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy:NewPlayAnimationTimeRangeProxyObject {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy.h#DreamUIAnimationPlayCallbackProxy:NewPlayAnimationTimeRangeProxyObject
    src   "Play a time range of an animation on the widget and trigger the Finished event when the instance is done."
    text  "在控件上播放动画的一段指定时间范围，并在实例完成时触发 Finished 事件。"
    state machine
}

